            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-2">
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-csk-gray">
                Ya. CSK dapat menangani kebutuhan produksi dalam jumlah<br/>
                kecil hingga project dengan kebutuhan produksi dan<br/>
                implementasi yang lebih besar.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-white">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-base font-bold uppercase leading-tight text-csk-black transition-colors hover:text-csk-amber">
              <span>Bagaimana cara memulai project?</span>
              <span class="ml-6 text-xl text-csk-gray transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-2">
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-csk-gray">
                Kirimkan kebutuhan project, ukuran, foto lokasi,<br/>
                atau referensi yang Anda miliki. Tim CSK akan membantu<br/>
                membahas kebutuhan dan langkah pengerjaan selanjutnya.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <Section class="text-center">
        <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-csk-black md:text-4xl">
          Punya Project yang Ingin Dikerjakan?
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-csk-gray">
          Kirim kebutuhan, ukuran, foto lokasi, atau referensi project Anda.<br/>
          Mari diskusikan kebutuhan produksi dan implementasinya bersama CSK.
        </p>
        <a href={waLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded bg-csk-black px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-csk-black/80">
          <WaIcon />Chat WhatsApp
        </a>
      </Section>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           <Lightbox />
      <style>
        [data-home-reveal] {
          transition:
            opacity 520ms ease,
            transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
            box-shadow 240ms ease;
        }

        [data-home-reveal][data-reveal-pending] {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translate3d(0, 18px, 0);
        }

        @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
          [data-home-reveal]:hover {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -24px rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.28);
          }
        }

        @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) and (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
          [data-home-reveal]:not([data-reveal-pending]):hover {
            transform: translate3d(0, -3px, 0);
          }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
          [data-home-reveal] {
            transition: none;
            transform: none;
          }
        }
      </style>

      <script>
        const homeCards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-home-reveal]'));
        const reducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');

        // Hero and immediately visible cards remain untouched for first paint.
        if ('IntersectionObserver' in window && !reducedMotion.matches) {
          const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            for (const entry of entries) {
              if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
              entry.target.removeAttribute('data-reveal-pending');
              observer.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          }, { threshold: 0.05, rootMargin: '0px 0px -24px 0px' });

          // Read all card positions first; DOM writes in this loop would force
          // repeated synchronous layouts on slower mobile devices.
          const belowFoldCards = homeCards.filter(
            (card) => card.getBoundingClientRect().top > window.innerHeight,
          );
          for (const card of belowFoldCards) {
            card.setAttribute('data-reveal-pending', '');
            observer.observe(card);
          }

          reducedMotion.addEventListener('change', () => {
            if (!reducedMotion.matches) return;
            observer.disconnect();
            for (const card of homeCards) card.removeAttribute('data-reveal-pending');
          });
        }
      </script>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           </Base>
